'''Catanduva''' ({{langx|tpn|Caa-tã-dyba}}; {{Literal translation|rough grass}}) is one of the two [[Regions of Balisca|regions]] of [[Pindorama]], within the [[Balisca|Baliscan Confederation]]. It is bounded to north and west by the [[W:Ilhas Cagarras|Cagarras Strait]], and shares a land border with [[Añãngaraçú]] to the east. The region's capital and largest city is [[Maracaju]]. 

